@startuml
[*] --> CreateAccount

state CreateAccount
CreateAccount --> Login : account created

state Login
Login --> ApplyVisa : apply for visa
Login --> CancelApplication : cancel application
Login --> ModifyDetails : modify details
Login --> ViewDetails : view details
Login --> Logout : log out

state ApplyVisa
ApplyVisa --> StatusCheck : check status

state StatusCheck <<choice>>
StatusCheck --> Approved : approved
StatusCheck --> Rejected : rejected

state Approved
Approved --> StatusUpdate : update status

state StatusUpdate
StatusUpdate --> CheckStatusAgain : check again
StatusUpdate --> GiveFeedback : give feedback

state CheckStatusAgain
CheckStatusAgain --> StatusUpdate : updated

state GiveFeedback
GiveFeedback --> Logout : log out
GiveFeedback --> Continue : continue

state CancelApplication
CancelApplication --> Logout : canceled

state ModifyDetails
ModifyDetails --> Login : details modified

state ViewDetails
ViewDetails --> Login : details viewed

state Approved --> [*] : process completed
state Rejected --> [*] : process rejected
state Logout --> [*] : logged out
@enduml
